==Description==

L'outil [[Image:Assembly_LinkSelectLinked.svg|24px]] [[Assembly_LinkSelectLinked/fr|Aller à l'assemblage lié]] ouvre le document source d'un assemblage lié.

<span id="Usage"></span>
==Utilisation==

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
# Select a linked assembly.
# Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_LinkSelectLinked.svg|16px]] Go to Linked Assembly}} option from the menu.
# The source document of the linked assembly is opened and the assembly is selected.
</div>


